    "SPK signature = Ed25519-detached over the RAW 32-byte X25519 SPK public key (no 0x05 type byte, unlike libsignal).",
    "SK = HKDF-SHA256(ikm = 0xFF×32 || DH1 || DH2 || DH3 [|| DH4], salt = undefined → 32 zero bytes (RFC 5869 default), info = \"mr.enzo.x3dh.v1\", L = 32). DH1 = X25519(IKa, SPKb), DH2 = X25519(EKa, IKb), DH3 = X25519(EKa, SPKb), DH4 = X25519(EKa, OPKb). Raw X25519 outputs (not HSalsa20).",
    "AD = IKa_pub(32) || IKb_pub(32) (sender first on both sides). keyIds are allocated from one monotonic counter shared by SPKs and OPKs (x3dhBootstrap.ts nextKeyId)."
